{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02596",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.27,
      "end_seconds": 8.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Doctor, your next patient is here. I've done the basics, I'll read them out in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.87,
      "end_seconds": 16.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.65,
      "end_seconds": 22.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.31,
      "end_seconds": 28.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.72,
      "end_seconds": 40.31,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a growing red ring on my thigh. I don't know what's causing it. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.95,
      "end_seconds": 43.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.05,
      "end_seconds": 50.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Clopidogrel i take it 75 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.56,
      "end_seconds": 51.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "yes, carry on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.74,
      "end_seconds": 61.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "I take diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed. I've been reading about it online and and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.54,
      "end_seconds": 70.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.11,
      "end_seconds": 76.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "About two years. Simvastatin, 20 milligrams, maybe, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.03,
      "end_seconds": 81.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.38,
      "end_seconds": 90.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.08,
      "end_seconds": 98.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a round yellow one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.49,
      "end_seconds": 102.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.28,
      "end_seconds": 119.08,
      "duration_seconds": 14.8,
      "text": "For my thyroid, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I used to take naproxen, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.48,
      "end_seconds": 136.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.84,
      "end_seconds": 140.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'd say a week, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 142.02,
      "end_seconds": 145.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "It was closer to two weeks, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.8,
      "end_seconds": 152.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "okay, so roughly one to two weeks is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.5,
      "end_seconds": 158.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Yeah, roughly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.45,
      "end_seconds": 165.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 165.96,
      "end_seconds": 172.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.41,
      "end_seconds": 175.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.39,
      "end_seconds": 183.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Let me think, there's a mild headache as well. As for mild headache, mostly severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.89,
      "end_seconds": 189.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "any aching muscles as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.8,
      "end_seconds": 200.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Yeah, that that too. About aching muscles, mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 201.58,
      "end_seconds": 205.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.56,
      "end_seconds": 212.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any stiff neck, palpitations or joint swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.06,
      "end_seconds": 225.44,
      "duration_seconds": 12.38,
      "text": "No, no stiff neck, no palpitations, no joint swelling. I did have tiredness at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.09,
      "end_seconds": 228.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Any sign of facial weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.19,
      "end_seconds": 231.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any facial weakness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.96,
      "end_seconds": 237.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.7,
      "end_seconds": 241.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Right, no, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.81,
      "end_seconds": 244.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.8,
      "end_seconds": 249.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.15,
      "end_seconds": 253.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.21,
      "end_seconds": 256.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.95,
      "end_seconds": 262.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.5,
      "end_seconds": 266.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "I have heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.57,
      "end_seconds": 270.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.64,
      "end_seconds": 282.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees, for nearly five years. Yes, high cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.16,
      "end_seconds": 285.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.3,
      "end_seconds": 295.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "uh, I've had an underactive thyroid, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.93,
      "end_seconds": 303.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Right, so arthritis in your knees and high cholesterol are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.7,
      "end_seconds": 323.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.5,
      "end_seconds": 329.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia. My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.48,
      "end_seconds": 333.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.88,
      "end_seconds": 339.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Just my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.28,
      "end_seconds": 342.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.34,
      "end_seconds": 352.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "Cat fur i come out in... well, sneezing. Tramadol i come out in... well, feeling very drowsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 355.46,
      "end_seconds": 364.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Saturation 99 percent, respiratory rate 15. BP is 123 over 78, temp 36.9 degrees, pulse 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.12,
      "end_seconds": 367.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "okay, good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.61,
      "end_seconds": 373.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.23,
      "end_seconds": 377.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.36,
      "end_seconds": 401.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "There is an expanding ring-shaped red patch, about eight centimetres across, on the thigh."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.53,
      "end_seconds": 418.19,
      "duration_seconds": 12.66,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like early Lyme disease. I can't rule out cellulitis yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.85,
      "end_seconds": 422.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.71,
      "end_seconds": 440.85,
      "duration_seconds": 18.14,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like early Lyme disease. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had a growing red ring on your thigh, and no joint swelling or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 441.76,
      "end_seconds": 442.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 443.13,
      "end_seconds": 461.32,
      "duration_seconds": 18.19,
      "text": "For this, doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day, twenty-one days. It's for early Lyme disease. Take the doxycycline with food and avoid strong sun. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 462.5,
      "end_seconds": 464.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "yes, will do"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 465.12,
      "end_seconds": 477.21,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. See me again in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 478.71,
      "end_seconds": 480.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "okay, I'll arrange it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 482.45,
      "end_seconds": 487.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you wanna to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 487.79,
      "end_seconds": 491.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Erm, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 492.54,
      "end_seconds": 493.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}